{"symbol":"LGLL","yahoo":"LGLL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Landmark Global Learning Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Consulting Services","website":"https://landmarkglobal.co.in","about":"Landmark Global Learning Limited provides overseas education consultancy and allied services. It offers education consultancy, career counselling, university and college selection, admission advice, application formalities, application and document review, statement of purpose and letter of recommendation guidance, scholarship advisory, education loan guidance, student visa services, visa file preparation, IELTS and other test preparation, travel and ticketing assistance, post-landing services, and post-study work and permanent residency guidance services. Landmark Global Learning Limited was formerly known as Landmark Immigration Consultants Limited and changed its name to Landmark Global Learning Limited in June 2025. The company was founded in 2007 and is headquartered in Chandigarh, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:56:51+00:00","quote":{"price":11.0,"prevClose":10.64,"marketCap":22.67,"high52":60.0,"low52":9.31,"pe":null,"bookValue":36.95,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":-9.12,"shares":2.061,"insiders":79.78,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-01-23","2025-01-24","2025-01-27","2025-01-28","2025-01-29","2025-01-30","2025-01-31","2025-02-03","2025-02-04","2025-02-05","2025-02-06","2025-02-07","2025-02-10","2025-02-11","2025-02-12","2025-02-13","2025-02-14","2025-02-17","2025-02-18","2025-02-19","2025-02-20","2025-02-21","2025-02-24","2025-02-25","2025-02-27","2025-02-28","2025-03-03","2025-03-04","2025-03-05","2025-03-06","2025-03-07","2025-03-10","2025-03-11","2025-03-12","2025-03-13","2025-03-17","2025-03-18","2025-03-19","2025-03-20","2025-03-21","2025-03-24","2025-03-25","2025-03-26","2025-03-27","2025-03-28","2025-04-01","2025-04-02","2025-04-03","2025-04-04","2025-04-07","2025-04-08","2025-04-09","2025-04-11","2025-04-15","2025-04-16","2025-04-